1. d4 c6 { The second vertebrae of this repertoire sees black unfurl the transpositional potential of this 1...c6 system, after 1. d4.
This is a move that few d4 players will have encountered, and the opening almost inevitably transposes into one of three systems. We will deal with these first. } *

