1. d4 c6 2. c4 d5 { However, black doesn't have to occupy the centre in the most direct fashion, and can instead essay the Queen's Gambit. When this occurs, we're going to play d5 anyway, and enter a new labyrinth of variations.
These next sections will be the longest in the repertoire, as black has countless options available, many of which are credible. } *

[Event "Complete Black c6 Repertoire: Inviting the Slav – 3. Nf3"]
[Date "2021.01.05"]
[Result "*"]
[Variant "Standard"]
[ECO "D48"]
